{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1835127583"}, "name":{"label":"Tigon Wolph"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-03T06:26:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.4"}, "id":{"label":"13809532865"}, "title":{"label":"Nailed it!"}, "content":{"label":"Structured absolutely nails what most planning apps miss: calm, clarity, and flow. Everything feels intentional — from the design to how tasks fit naturally into your day instead of overwhelming you. \n\nIt’s simple without being shallow, and its powerful without being complicated. Using it actually makes me feel more focused and less stressed, which is rare for productivity apps.\n\nYou can tell a lot of care went into this. \n\nPS\nIf you want structure that supports you instead of bossing you around, this is it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
