{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id113367208"}, "name":{"label":"AppTracksYou"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-26T07:52:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.4"}, "id":{"label":"13791654073"}, "title":{"label":"Useful. However Causes Excess Battery Drain"}, "content":{"label":"Honestly, this is a really good application. I really love the UI and it’s pretty easy to use. I especially love how there is a Web version which allows me to use it for my day to day planning at work. Overall it’s intuitive and very good for people who like to stay organized and use daily planners. The one caveat with this application and the only reason I didn’t give it 5 stars (and also the reason I am on the fence about subscribing for it) is the battery drain on this app. It appears that this application has NOT been optimized AT ALL for battery efficiency. I am on the iPhone 17 Pro Max, my battery is fantastic. That said - THIS APP DRAINS IT. After several days of usage, I’ve been able to determine it drains about 0.36% of battery per minute. Which I mean, doesn’t seem like much at first glance. But when you run the math on it, that means just using this app for about 25ish minutes a day will drain 10% of your battery.. That’s a lot for a todo/daily planner application. The first day I got the app and I set up my schedule and all my repeating tasks, I used the app for about 1 hour and 5 minutes of screen on time, that resulted in 25% battery usage. To be blunt, that’s horrendously poor optimization. Just for perspective, highly resource intensive applications such as BlackMagic Camera when filming in 60 FPS at 4K use the EXACT SAME amount of battery as this application per minute. There is no reason a daily planner should drain just as much and sometimes more than a highly intensive and resource demanding video recording application. This should definitely be investigated.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id386568091"}, "name":{"label":"JK_BC808"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-18T21:35:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"13765038676"}, "title":{"label":"Best one out there"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried different planners and nothing has compared to Structured. Very aesthetically pleasing and user friendly. Some of the last update took getting used to but after the developer advised me how to access the feature it’s a solid improvement! Will keep using for my daily and weekly tasks, and am getting more use out of the inbox for “unstructured” to dos.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
