{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1470995338"}, "name":{"label":"notyoursub"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-27T09:45:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"13682255437"}, "title":{"label":"Great app but with bugs"}, "content":{"label":"Structured is a great app to manage my day-to-day life. I really like the amount of customizing I can do to each task, and the weekly view is great. I also love that I am able to use the app both on Mac and Android with consistent syncing.\n\nThere are just lots of bugs that makes the Mac app hard to use. To start, I understand your team is small, so I do not expect lots. \nIt takes an unnecessarily amount of time for the colour and icon panel to open when customizing a task. Clicking on a task to edit when in the weekly view sometimes does not open the edit panel, I’d have to scroll the timeline for it to respond. Finally, the app just crashes randomly. Recently it crashed 3 times in a row. It’s drawing me towards the web app. \n\nOne more thing, I’d love to see the multi-day view on the Mac app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
